window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Lilliana</b></p><p>I’m tired of the same old thing. My job as a marketing executive leaves me unfulfilled and yearning for something more.</p><p>Leave it to my bestie to push me into a dating app.</p><p>I’m not very optimistic, but then I’m matched with a mysterious stranger named Dash…<br><br>He promises me a world of ecstasy beyond my wildest dreams, and maybe—just <i>maybe</i>—he’s someone I can explore my darkest desires with.</p><p>Our connection is instant, and everything seems perfect.</p><p>At first.</p><p>Then, a darker side of Dash begins to surface—a jealous, obsessive, possessive, dominant side.</p><p>A side that says he’s never going to let me go.</p>"; 
